From: =?UTF-8?q?Andr=C3=A9=20Machado?= <machaddr@falanet.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 16:40:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 22/53] drm/bridge: cdns-dsi: add StarFive JH7110 support

Adapt the StarFive wrapper to the Linux 7.3 atomic Cadence DSI core.
Manage the additional clocks and resets, align the D-PHY lane rate,
compensate horizontal blanking, and unwind runtime state on every failure.

The wrapper is adapted from the JH7110 work by Keith Zhao and
Shengyang Chen.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20240513074607.28271-3-shengyang.chen@starfivetech.com
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
